SQLarius: Excellent work, brave apprentice! You have uncovered the hidden inventory—the Root Password USB and the CEO Keycard Clone.
MainCharacter: (Points to the output screen)
SQLarius: This is the power of [color=#00ccff]Data Discovery[/color]! You forced the database to show you things it keeps hidden.
SQLarius: However, we still haven't found the wizard's stolen powers. We are looking for the [wave]map[/wave] of this entire building, not just the contents of one drawer.
SQLarius: If you can access the "products" table, what if you could access the server's own [color=#ffcc00]master list[/color]... the internal blueprint of every table that exists here?
SQLarius: Try to replace the name of the loot table with the name of the database's own master file. Find the map, and we can move on!